Name: RealizedVolatility
Purpose: To build realized volatility
Responsabilities:
    - To create `TickAverage` module
    - To create `TickState` module
    - To create the `Window` type
    - To support `fixedTimeFrequency` `Window` type constructor
    - To define the `RealizedVolatility` as
\(\mathrm{Vol} (\mathrm{Window}; t) \, = (\mathrm{Window})^{-1} \times \sum_{t=t_{\text{now}} - \text{Window}}^{t_{\text{now}}} \Big [i(t_{\text{now}}) \, - \, i_{\mu} (t)\Big ]^2\)
    - To define \(\sigma_{\text{factory}} : T \times \bar \sigma \to \text{TickPath} \equiv \{i\}_{j=0}^{N}\) and implement as a discrete time control macro
    - To define \(\mu_F, \sigma_F\) *constants*
    - To implement [\(\epsilon (t_i) \sim \mathcal{N} \, (0,1)\)](https://fravoll.github.io/solidity-patterns/randomness.html)
								  - To define \(\Delta W (t_i) = \sqrt{\bar dt} \, \cdot\, \epsilon \, (t_i)\) type constructor

								  - To support the placing of constant \(L_{1/2}\) over a fixed [`TickBucket`]() using [`TargetVega`]()
